"array and optionally the length (which will be a non-negative decimal "
"integer). Such placeholders are enclosed in ``@`` at the beginning and end "
"of the placeholder. This functionality is similar to :command:"
"`configure_file` called with the ``@ONLY`` argument, but only the array and "
"length placeholders will be replaced, and any other placeholders will be "
"left as-is."
