#: ../../../manual/cmake.1.rst:1775
msgid ""
"The value ``0`` is used to specify the default compression level. It is "
"selected automatically by the archive library backend and not directly set "
"by CMake itself. The default compression level may vary between archive "
"formats, platforms, etc."
